Aim

To develop an online hotel booking system for searching, booking, modifying, and cancelling hotel room reservations.

Algorithm
Start the program.
Register and log in to the system.
Search for hotels and check room availability.
Select a room, enter guest details, and book the room.
Make payment and receive booking confirmation.
Allow users to view, modify, or cancel bookings.
Admin manages rooms, prices, bookings, and hotel details.
Stop the program.
Result

Thus, the online hotel room booking system was designed to manage room availability, reservations, payments, and cancellations efficiently.
